# flip-frames (H6): flipping a=2 on x², on the paused clock. The flip
# toggle's centre is (218, 450.5) at 1440x900 (probed on the reference at
# 5196; re-measure if h5's rows move it). The click writes a=-2 to the URL
# at once; flip-f0 shows the render-phase curves (plane still a=2.00); the
# frames lines shoot at +100, +300, +600 and +1000 ms (model: 1.07, about
# -1.04, about -1.90, exactly -2.00; the run's views shown lines pin each
# frame). Behaviour: url line func=x2&a=-2 right after the click; views
# shown lines each frame the spring moves.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2
wait 2000
click 218 450.5
shot flip-f0
frames flip-f100 every 100 for 100
frames flip-f300 every 200 for 200
frames flip-f600 every 300 for 300
frames flip-f1000 every 400 for 400
